SYNTHETIC DEVELOPMENT CORPUS

Every document in this directory is fictional. Company, venue, vendor and
people names are invented. The corpus exists so the demo fixtures in
evals/fixtures/ (which mirror the worked examples in the Theme 04 guide) have
something real to retrieve from. The engine never reads this directory by
name: it is mounted via SLR_CORPUS_DIR like any other corpus, and the held-out
graders' corpus replaces it the same way.

This file has no supported extension, so the ingester skips it.
